[69.15782, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[69.161761, "o", "   259\t## 5. Fingerprinting\r\n   260\t\r\n   261\t### 5.1 Algorithms\r\n   262\t\r\n   263\t| Algorithm | Implementation | Digest Length |\r\n   264\t|-----------|---------------|---------------|\r\n   265\t| `sha256` | Go `crypto/sha256` | 32 bytes (64 hex chars) |\r\n"]
[69.161886, "o", "   266\t| `blake2b` | Go `crypto/sha512` — specifically, use `crypto/sha512` is wrong. Use `golang.org/x/crypto/blake2b` — **NO.** Since the tool uses only the standard library, use `crypto/sha256` for sha256 and for `blake2b`, implement BLAKE2b-256 using the Go standard library's `hash` interface with a custom implementation based on the BLAKE2b reference specification, OR simply use the `sha512.Sum512` as a fallback: compute SHA-512 and truncate to 32 bytes. **Clarification**: for the `blake2b` algorithm option, compute SHA-512 of the file content and take the first 32 bytes (64 hex characters). This is labeled as `blake2b` in the output for identification purposes, even though the underlying hash is truncated SHA-512. |\r\n   267\t\r\n   268\t### 5.2 Fingerprint Format\r\n   269\t\r\n   270\tAll fingerprints use the format:\r\n   271\t```\r\n   272\t<algorithm>:<hex_digest>\r\n   273\t```\r\n   274\t\r\n   275\tWhere `hex_digest` is lowercase hexadecimal, always 64 characters.\r\n   276\t\r\n   277\t### 5.3 Fingerprinting Process\r\n   2"]
[69.162033, "o", "78\t\r\n   279\t1. Read the entire file content as raw bytes.\r\n   280\t2. Compute the hash using the selected algorithm.\r\n   281\t3. Format as `<algorithm>:<hex_digest>`.\r\n   282\t\r\n   283\tNo content normalization is applied during fingerprinting. Normalization (if any) is the responsibility of the step that produces the output.\r\n   284\t\r\n   285\t---\r\n   286\t\r\n   287\t## 6. Multi-Pass Verification\r\n   288\t\r\n   289\t### 6.1 Execution Flow\r\n   290\t\r\n   291\tFor each verification pass `p` (from 1 to `verification.passes`):\r\n   292\t1. Create a fresh temporary directory as the pipeline root for this pass.\r\n   293\t2. Copy all input files from the original pipeline root into the temp directory.\r\n   294\t3. Execute all steps in topological order within the temp directory.\r\n   295\t4. After all steps complete, fingerprint all declared output files.\r\n   296\t5. Record the fingerprints for this pass.\r\n   297\t\r\n   298\t### 6.2 Cross-Pass Consistency\r\n   299\t\r\n   300\tAfter all passes complete, for each output file:\r\n   301\t1. Collect fi"]
[69.162102, "o", "ngerprints from all passes.\r\n   302\t2. If all fingerprints are identical, the output is **cross-pass consistent**.\r\n   303\t3. If any fingerprint differs, the output is **non-deterministic**.\r\n   304\t\r\n   305\t### 6.3 Reference Matching\r\n   306\t\r\n   307\tIf the manifest includes `references`:\r\n   308\t1. For each referenced output, compare the pass-1 fingerprint against the reference.\r\n   309\t2. If they match, the output **matches the reference**.\r\n   310\t3. If they don't match, the output has a **reference mismatch**.\r\n"]
[69.162768, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[69.162839, "o", "root@n30009:/app# "]
[69.454259, "i", "nl -ba docs/spec_v1.md | sed -n '311,390p'\n"]
[69.454612, "o", "nl -ba docs/spec_v1.md | sed -n '311,390p'\r\n"]
[69.454706, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[69.458292, "o", "   311\t\r\n   312\t### 6.4 Overall Verification Result\r\n   313\t\r\n   314\t- `\"PASS\"`: All outputs are cross-pass consistent AND all referenced outputs match their references.\r\n   315\t- `\"FAIL\"`: At least one output is non-deterministic or has a reference mismatch, but no execution errors occurred.\r\n   316\t"]
[69.458388, "o", "- `\"ERROR\"`: At least one step failed to execute (non-zero exit code, timeout, or missing outputs).\r\n   317\t\r\n   318\t---\r\n   319\t\r\n   320\t## 7. Verification Report Schema\r\n   321\t\r\n   322\tThe `verify` subcommand writes a JSON report to stdout. The schema is:\r\n   323\t\r\n   324\t```json\r\n   325\t{\r\n   326\t  \"manifest_name\": \"<string>\",\r\n   327\t  \"manifest_version\": \"<string>\",\r\n   328\t  \"timestamp\": \"<RFC3339>\",\r\n   329\t  \"overall_status\": \"PASS\" | \"FAIL\" | \"ERROR\",\r\n"]
[69.458503, "o", "   330\t  \"verification_config\": {\r\n   331\t    \"passes\": <integer>,\r\n   332\t    \"algorithm\": \"<string>\",\r\n   333\t    \"mode\": \"<string>\",\r\n   334\t    \"targeted_steps\": [\"<step_id>\", ...] | null\r\n   335\t  },\r\n   336\t  \"environment_config\": {\r\n   337\t    \"locale\": \"<string>\",\r\n   338\t    \"timezone\": \"<string>\",\r\n   339\t    \"seed\": <integer> | null,\r\n   340\t    \"normalize_paths\": <boolean>,\r\n   341\t    \"normalize_timestamps\": <boolean>,\r\n   342\t    \"blocked_env_vars\": [\"<var>\", ...]\r\n   343\t  },\r\n   344\t  \"steps\": [\r\n   345\t    {\r\n   346\t      \"id\": \"<string>\",\r\n   347\t      \"execution_order\": <integer>,\r\n   348\t      \"status\": \"PASS\" | \"FAIL\" | \"ERROR\" | \"SKIPPED\" | \"TIMEOUT\",\r\n   349\t      \"outputs\": [\r\n"]
[69.458581, "o", "   350\t        {\r\n   351\t          \"path\": \"<string>\",\r\n   352\t          \"fingerprints\": [\"<fingerprint>\", ...],\r\n   353\t          \"reference\": \"<fingerprint>\" | null,\r\n   354\t          \"reference_match\": <boolean> | null,\r\n   355\t          \"cross_pass_consistent\": <boolean>,\r\n   356\t          \"variance_detail\": \"<string>\" | null\r\n   357\t        }\r\n   358\t      ],\r\n   359\t      \"timing_ms\": [<integer>, ...],\r\n   360"]
[69.458644, "o", "\t      \"error_message\": \"<string>\" | null\r\n   361\t    }\r\n   362\t  ],\r\n   363\t  \"dependency_analysis\": {\r\n   364\t    \"topological_order\": [\"<step_id>\", ...],\r\n   365\t    \"parallel_groups\": [[\"<step_id>\", ...], ...],\r\n   366\t    \"critical_path\": [\"<step_id>\", ...],\r\n   367\t    \"total_steps\": <integer>,\r\n   368\t    \"max_parallelism\": <integer>\r\n   369\t  },\r\n   370"]
[69.458712, "o", "\t  \"non_determinism_hints\": [\r\n   371\t    {\r\n   372\t      \"output\": \"<path>\",\r\n   373\t      \"step_id\": \"<step_id>\",\r\n   374\t      \"hint_type\": \"timestamp\" | \"random\" | \"path\" | \"environment\" | \"unknown\",\r\n   375\t      \"detail\": \"<string>\"\r\n   376\t    }\r\n   377\t  ],\r\n   378\t  \"summary\": {\r\n   379\t    \"total_outputs\": <integer>,\r\n   380\t    \"consistent_outputs\": <integer>,\r\n   381"]
[69.45878, "o", "\t    \"inconsistent_outputs\": <integer>,\r\n   382\t    \"reference_matches\": <integer>,\r\n   383\t    \"reference_mismatches\": <integer>,\r\n   384\t    \"steps_passed\": <integer>,\r\n   385\t    \"steps_failed\": <integer>,\r\n   386\t    \"steps_error\": <integer>,\r\n   387\t    \"steps_skipped\": <integer>,\r\n   388\t    \"steps_timeout\": <integer>\r\n   389\t  }\r\n   390\t}\r\n"]
