[2666.334391, "o", "1:# Repro-Verify Specification v2\r\n12:## 13. Verification Policy Engine\r\n14:### 13.1 Policy Section in Manifest\r\n40:### 13.2 Rule Schema\r\n58:### 13.3 Rule Types\r\n60:#### `allow_variance`\r\n"]
