[3777.582184, "o", "ic pipeline that would produce `overall_status: \"FAIL\"` under v1 rules MUST still show `overall_status: \"FAIL\"` even if a policy rule allows the variance.\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:17:- The policy engine affects ONLY:\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:18:  1. The `policy_evaluation` section of the report\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:20:- Any implementation that modifies `overall_status` based on policy rules is incorrect.\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:26:- Exit code `1` MUST be returned when any step has a `status_transition` of type `\"regression\"` (i.e., when `summary.regressions >= 1`).\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:27:- Exit code `0` is returned ONLY when there are zero regressions, even if there are improvements or other changes.\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:37:repro-verify summary <report1.json> [report2.json ...]\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:40:Reads one or more verification report JSON files and produces a concise summary.\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:51:  \"summary_timestamp\": \"<RFC3339>\",\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:57:      \"overall_status\": \"<string>\",\r\ndocs/spec_v3.md:86:- `aggregate.all_passing`: `true` if"]
