[6224.336762, "o", "13:The status ranks used by the `trend` subcommand (Section 17.2) for `classification` are revised:\r\n21:| `TIMEOUT` | 1 |\r\n28:| `TIMEOUT` | 3 |\r\n33:**Rationale:** A `TIMEOUT` indicates the step ran but exceeded its time limit — it was closer to completing. A `FAIL` indicates the step produced incorrect results — a fundamental correctness issue. `ERROR` represents an unrecoverable runtime error, between the two.\r\n"]
