[6521.380105, "o", "     1\t# Repro-Verify Specification v6\r\n     2\t\r\n     3\tThis document extends `spec_v5.md` with one new feature added in v6.\r\n     4\t\r\n     5\tAll previous behavior remains unchanged unless explicitly overridden below.\r\n     6\t\r\n     7\t---\r\n     8\t\r\n"]
[6521.38026, "o", "     9\t## 20. Export Subcommand\r\n    10\t\r\n    11\t### 20.1 Usage\r\n    12\t\r\n    13\t```\r\n    14\trepro-verify export <report.json>\r\n    15\t```\r\n    16\t\r\n    17\tReads a verification report JSON file and exports the step-level data as CSV to stdout.\r\n    18\t\r\n    19\t### 20.2 CSV Output Format\r\n    20\t\r\n    21\t```\r\n    22\tstep_id,status,output_count\r\n    23\t<id1>,<status1>,<count1>\r\n    24\t<id2>,<status2>,<count2>\r\n    25\t```\r\n    26\t\r\n    27\t**Field details:**\r\n    28\t\r\n    29\t- First line is always the header: `step_id,status,output_count`.\r\n    30\t- One data line per step, in the same order as the report's `steps` array.\r\n    31\t- `step_id`: The step's `id` field.\r\n    32\t- `status`: The step's `status` field.\r\n    33\t- `output_count`: Number of entries in the step's `outputs` array. If the step has no `outputs` field or the array is null, output count is `0`.\r\n    34\t- No quotes around fields.\r\n    35\t- No trailing whitespace or extra blank lines after the last data row.\r\n"]
[6521.380344, "o", "    36\t\r\n    37\t### 20.3 Exit Codes\r\n    38\t\r\n    39\t| Code | Meaning |\r\n    40\t|------|---------|\r\n    41\t| `0` | Export successful (including when the report has zero steps — just the header is output). |\r\n    42\t| `2` | Error (file not found, invalid JSON, missing required fields). |\r\n    43\t\r\n    44\t### 20.4 Input Validation\r\n    45\t\r\n    46\t- The input file must exist and be valid JSON containing at minimum `manifest_name`, `overall_status`, and `steps` array.\r\n    47\t- If validation fails, exit with code 2 and print to stderr:\r\n    48\t  - `error: export file not found: <path>`\r\n    49\t  - `error: invalid export input: <path>: <reason>`\r\n"]
[6521.380914, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[6521.38099, "o", "root@n30009:/app# "]
[6527.190665, "i", "nl -ba cmd/repro-verify/main.go | sed -n '1,260p'\n"]
